<title śrīgurustutiratnāvalī  >
<no. 1307-ka>
<author govindakaula>
<extent 11>
<subject stotra>

<pṛ0 1a> oṃśrīdevyainamaḥ sākṣātkṛtyanijaṃsvarūpamamalaṃ 
yadbhātivipruṇmayaṃ hitvābhrāṃtimatiṃmaheśitiyo 
devarṣimartyaiḥstutaḥ baddhānbhaktajanānvimocaya
tisatkāraṇyadṛṣṭyākṣaṇāt kauleśaṃkulaśekha
raṃguruvaraṃdhyāyāmitaṃsāhibaṃ (1) yasyaikasyavibhorvi
bhāvikasatātprodetiviśvaṃsthitiṃ vyāpnotyaṃśuni
meṣaṇātkṣaṇamapipratyastamāyātyaho svacchaṃdaṃsa

<pṛ0 1ba> tatoditaṃsakalagaṃpūrṇaṃviśuddhaṃsadā naumyānaṃda
nidhiṃcidaṃbaramaṇiṃśrīsāhibaṃtaṃśivaṃ (2) ādāvā
dhārapadmātpratibhuvanamalaṃbhāsayansvaprabhābhiḥ 
śritvāmaṃdārabiṃdākaramamṛtavapuḥpākṣakaṃjasrutai
ryaḥ siṃcanpīyūṣavarṣaiḥsuramunipitṛkānkārmi
kāṃstīrthyasaṃghān brahmāṃḍāgāraśaṃbhuḥsphuratiparama
hastadbhajesāhivākhyaṃ (3) dhātāyasyapadābjavaṃdanara

<pṛ0 2a> sātsargaṃtanotīśate viṣṇurjiṣṇusakhācarakṣatipa
dāṃbhojārcanātsaṃhṛtiṃ rudraśceśasadāśivautri
jagatobhrūbhaṃgiśiṣṭyāpidhāṃ kāruṇyaṃtanutovibhuṃ
paraśivaṃtaṃsāhibaṃtvārcaye (4) tvaṃsvātaṃtryaruciścabha
ktajanatādhīnātmakastvaṃprabho tvaṃviśvāśrayattattvabhū
tijanitātvaṃtattvatonāśritaḥ tvaṃkṛtsnajñavidhātṛ
tādyavayavītvaṃkaṃcukāṃtarpitastvaṃkāruṇyanidhi

<pṛ0 2ba> stvapāramahimāśrīsāhivaṃtāṃstuve (5) kāyaḥkāya
tikalpitaḥkilaśilākalpāhṛṣīkabrajā hṛṣyaṃ
tiprabhavobhavasthitilayānbhāveṣukartuṃsphuṭaṃ 
prāṇaḥprāṇatiyanmarīcikalayātaṃjīvajīvaṃśi
vaṃ cinnāthaṃsahajaṃnijaṃgurutamaṃdhāmāśrayesāhi
baṃ (6) māyāsuptasamastajaṃtutatiṣūjjāgartyajasraṃ 
cayaḥ ṣaḍbhāvāṃvikṛtiṃvivartayatiyosaunirvi

<pṛ0 3a> kāraḥsvayaṃ ekonekatayāsvaśaktilaharīvṛṃdairnijaṃ
khelayannaikākārivāṃbudhairanumitastaṃbhāvayesāhi
vaṃ (7) kartātarkanayevimuktapuruṣaḥsāṃkhyejinaḥsau
gate śavdātmādhvaniśāsanevidhiyutaṃkarmāyanejai
mineḥ brahmaikaṃśrutimastakeharirayaṃyogīyatevaiṣṇa
ve śaiveśaṃbhuraśeṣarūpamatulaṃtaṃsāhivaṃsaṃśraye (8) 
nityāhlādamayaṃnirāmayamuṃnirdhūtatīrthyāṃhasaṃ 

<pṛ0 3ba> nirdvaṃdvākalanaṃnirādinidhanaṃnirdvaitavodhātmakaṃ 
niḥspaṃdasphuritaṃniruttarakalāśliṣṭaṃguruṃnimalaṃ 
niśśeṣāśrayamīśvaraṃnirupamaṃnityaṃbhajesāhivaṃ 
(9) saṃvidyotavimarṣaharṣavapuṣānākeprakāśyābhi
to yenaprāgdivisatyabodhabharitaṃtejaḥsamullāsi
taṃ svaṃsvacchaṃpratibhāsvabhāvasubhagaṃcordhyāṃprasaṃtupri
yāñ śiṣyānkāruṇikaṃśivaṃnavatanuṃpreḍeguruṃ

<pṛ0 4a> sāhibaṃ (10) yanmūrtirbhuvanemahātmabhiralaṃdhyeyāsa
hasracchade padmemūrdhnisitāṃbarātrinayanāsomāsa
nāsomabhāḥ cinmudrāvarapustakābhayakarāvāmā
rdhadevyaṃkitā bhaktānugrahatatparāparaśivaṃtaṃsāhi
vaṃbhāvaye (11) aṃtardhāyabhujaukalāṃcaśaśinorbhā
lekṣaṇaṃbhūtale soyaṃśaṃkaranāthevaviharannācā
ryagātrasthitaḥ sākṣānnrūndayateparādvayadṛśāsaṃ

<pṛ0 4ba> muktamūrtyāgirā saccitsātaghanaṃnamāmiparame
śānaṃprabhuṃsāhivaṃ (12) yaḥpādadvayanirgalatpara
sudhādhārābhirārādhakān saṃtarpyāvirataṃpadābja 
śaraṇāndāsānsvamebhyaḥsvabhaḥ svāmīsvarviṣa
yātiśāyimuditaṃdatteprabhutvaṃmahajjīvanmukti
vibhūṣitaṃparaśivaṃtaṃsāhivaṃsaṃstuve (13) tārātmā
bhavatārakomarayutairlokeśakeśeśvarairekoyokhi

<pṛ0 5a> lavāṅmayāmṛtanidhiściddharṣapūrṇodhruvaḥ brahmāṃ
ḍādvipulopyaṇoraṇutamojyotistamojyotiṣāṃ 
svātmaikyātparimṛśyateparaśivaṃtaṃsaṃbhajesāhibaṃ 
(14) vāgyasmātpraṇatārtināśanapaṭumaṃdākinī
veśvarāṭhṛtkāluṣyamṛjākṣamāmunimatāpūtā 
prasādāspadā srotovisṛtibhāgavātaradaraṃtīrthā
rthisārthārcitā viśveśaṃgurusattamaṃśivakaraṃvaṃde

<pṛ0 5ba> vibhuṃsāhivaṃ (15) māyeyaṃmahitāpradhānamahilā 
svātaṃtryalīlotsavā svāsvābhāvikabhāvabhāvapa
ṭaladvaitaprathādāyinī yasyeśasyacakāstibhāva
viyutāḥkemohitānoyayā durbodhātmikayātri
viṣṭapaguruṃtaṃsāhibaṃsaṃśraye (16) lakṣmīryasyaja
gatprabhoravirataṃpādābjasaktāśayai styaktākṛttri
marūpatopyakṛtakānaṃdādṛḍhaṃsaṃśritā sphūrjadbhaktya

<pṛ0 6a> vibhaktamuktivibhavātaṃpūrṇaśaktiṃprabhuṃśrīnāthaṃguru
cakravartinamahaṃnaumīśvaraṃsāhibaṃ (17) ākāśoḍu
ṣukāśatesitakaraḥsnigdhoyathāsevyate sarvarddhi
ścajanārdanaḥsuragaṇaiścaṃḍānalaujāstathā trailokye
pikalāḍhyacaṃdrarucirovaṃdyoyīśodvayo māheśai
rbhajatāṃśaraṇyamaniśaṃtaṃsāhivaṃtvāṃstuve (18) śaṃbhu
stvaṃparaśaktimāṃstusakalakleśaikavaiśvānaraḥ saṃva

<pṛ0 6ba> rtastvamanādyadainyagahanetvaṃkālakālomahān 
iṃdrastvaṃvaruṇānilaumadhuripuḥ sābjopyakhaṃḍātma
kastvāṃśrīsāhibamarcayāmisakalottīrṇaṃmahe
śaṃguruṃ (19) cadrārkekṣaṇamaṣṭaśaktigiriśaṃdyo
mastakaṃnābhikhaṃ kukṣisthāṃbunidhiṃhutāśavadanaṃ 
sūkṣmāmṛtāsitaṃ dikkarṇaṃcaraṇakṣitiṃkhaluja
gatprāṇaṃtvakrūrātmakaṃ śrīnāthaṃsuvirājamadbhu

<pṛ0 7a> tatanuṃtvāṃsāhivaṃbhāvaye (20) śaṃkārāśyaśaniṃnabho
tipṛthulaṃnityaṃnutaṃnirjaraiḥ śrīvaikuṃṭhapinākinā
yakamukhaiḥpīyūṣaharṣātmakaṃ yogāṃtāgninibhaṃjaga
dgurugarīyāṃsaṃhṛdisthaṃśivaṃ śāṃtyākrāṃtamanu
ttaraṃdhruvamajaṃvaṃdevibhuṃsāhibaṃ (21) śrīviśveśvarabhai
ravotikaruṇoharṣeśvarīsaṃyutaḥ sāmnāyāgama
sampradāyasumaṇīṃścopādidikṣuḥśritān a

<pṛ0 7ba> vyaktopikṛpāvatāramamalaṃvyānaṃjabodhodadhiṃ 
yaṃkauleśapatiṃviśālayaśasaṃjīyādasausāhi
vaḥ (22) yaḥśūnyākṛtipūrṇaśaktikhacitaḥśūnyā
layaḥsansudhā naṃdāḍhyobhuvanaṃpipartisakalaṃ
yonirguṇoniṣkalaḥ dvaitādvaitakalāśrayopimu
nibhiryogīśvarairgīyate cidrūpaṃgurupuṣkalaṃpara
śivaṃtaṃsāhibaṃsaṃśraye (23) brahmāmnāyasarasvatī

<pṛ0 8a> śritamukhohaṃsasthitaḥprītimān drāksaṃkarṣaṇadai
vatāgnimamahāsenādiyuktaḥsvayaṃ śrīnāthaṃsatataṃ
gṛṇātijagatījaittraṃyasīddhyaṃgurormūrtisthaṃpraṇato
smitaṃparaśivaṃśrīsāhivaṃsarvaśaḥ (24) maṃtrāmāṃtrika
maṃtryarūpabhagavandevādhidevaprabho śrīśrīkaulaku
leśadeśikaparānaṃdādināthābhayaṃ śaktyāśliṣṭava
puḥprasannavadanodatsevaraṃcepsitaṃ nityaṃśrīparapā

<pṛ0 8ba> dukāṃcaśivayorvāṃpūjayāmyānataḥ (25) pāśaidhoda
hanaṃhṛdutpalasudhāraśmiṃstuvetvāṃmṛḍaṃ dvaitādhvāṃtara
viṃtridhāmadharaṇiṃśrīsāhibaṃsadguruṃ pūjyāṃghreśi
vapālanātsuduritadhvaṃsāścakāmyānṛṇāt sma
rtṛṇāṃtriguṇādhipāvijayateśrīpādukāteśubhā (26) 
yodevatrayavarṇyavīryavibhavopyardheṃdulekhojjvalaḥ 
saṃcetyaughanirodhinādagaganāṃttasthomahāvyāpakaḥ 

<pṛ0 9a> cittattvaspṛgamoghaśaktiruditoyacconmanācetana sta
ttvajñaiḥpraṇatositaṃparaśivaṃtvāṃsāhibaṃsaṃbhaje (27)
kālākāradigādyakṛttavapuṣodhyānaṃnukiṃtevibho  
tvaṃviṣvagjagadathitārthajanakopyarcāvidhistekathaṃ  
ādikṣāṃtasuvarṇabhāsuratanoḥkātestutiḥsāhibaṃ 
satyaṃśāṃtamanuttamaṃguruvaraṃtaṃtvāṃprapadyeprabhuṃ (25(28)) snā
tvādaupariśuddhaviṃdusarasaściccaṃdrasāṃdrāmṛtaiḥ prokṣyā

<pṛ0 9ba> dhāradharāṃsvabhāvakusumaisturyāṭavīdyotitaiḥ kṛ
tvānaṃdasudhaughapūrṇahṛdayānarghārghapātraṃsadā tvāṃ 
devyāsahadehadevanilayenāthārcayesāhibaṃ (29) 
mūrkhobhijñatinākatīhabhavanaṃmittratparirdāsati 
kṣmābhṛnmokṣatisaṃsṛtirnamativaigarvyaṃtakovaidya
ti bhogoyogatikalmaṣaṃsukṛtatitvatpādukārco
tsavāttvāṃtaṃstaumidayālumīḍyacaraṇaṃśrīsāhibaṃ 

<pṛ0 10a> śaṃkaraṃ (30) diṣṭyātriṃśatipadyahṛdyamaṇibhiḥprotāma
heśātmaka śrīmāheśvaryavaryadaiśikapateḥpatsto
traratnāvalī śrīkauleśvarasāhivetimahitakhyā
tābhidhasyeśiturbhaktyaiṣāviniveditāṃghrikamale 
saṃtuṣṭayebhāsatāṃ (31) nāthasyāsyapadābjareṇubhaja
nātprāptaprasādovibhuḥ saddharṣācitacitsvarūpa
sakalajyotiṣprakāśāhvayaḥ nāgeṃdrāsyakṛpālu

<pṛ0 10ba (PḍF ṇ(0). (24))> māpatimukhaiḥstutyāṃghripadmopyayaṃ śarvātmājaya
tipradīpitamahāmāheśvaratvāspadaḥ (32) śrīśāke 
śrutināgatarkaśaśisaṃkhyātesyaviśveśituḥ pā
dāṃbhojamadhubratomadhusitāṣṭamyāṃsaparyotsave  
śrīgoviṃdupāharannavamaṇiśreṇīmimāṃtvanvahaṃ  
yedadhyuḥsvagaleśrayaṃtisudhiyastebhogamokṣaśriyaṃ 
(33) [itiśrīmahāmāheśvarācāryaśrīmacchrījyoti(*)

<pṛ0 11a (PḍF ṇo.(23))> [ṣprakāśakaulānaṃdanāthapādapadmānujīviśrīgo
viṃdakaulaviracitāśrīgurustutiratnāvalīsa
māptāsaṃpūrṇācetiśivamom] || 

